   "title": "Ghana risks industrial stagnation if research fails to reach industry",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/ghana-risks-industrial-stagnation-if-research-fails-to-reach-industry-zanetor/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
   "published": "Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:30:11 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793032211.0,
   "ageDays": 0.06,
   "summary": "Environment, Science and Technology Minister Zanetor Agyeman-Rawlings has warned that Ghana risks industrial stagnation if universities and research institutions fail to translate scientific discoveries into practical solutions for businesses and industry. She said the disconnect between academic research and commercial application was limiting the country’s ability to turn scientific knowledge into industrial growth, job creation and economic development.",
   "summary_zh": "环境、科学与技术部长泽内托尔·阿吉曼-罗林斯警告称，如果加纳各大学和研究机构未能将科学发现转化为面向企业和产业的切实解决方案，该国将面临工业停滞的风险。她表示，学术研究与商业应用之间的脱节，限制了加纳将科学知识转化为工业增长、就业创造和经济发展的能力。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "Environment, Science and Technology Minister Zanetor Agyeman-Rawlings has warned that Ghana risks industrial stagnation if universities and research institutions fail to translate scientific discoveries into practical solutions for businesses and industry. She said the disconnect between academic research and commercial application was limiting the country’s ability to turn scientific knowledge into industrial growth, job creation and economic development. Dr Agyeman-Rawlings was speaking at the opening of the 2026 Oliver Reginald (O.R.) Tambo Chairs Initiative (ORTARChI) Conference at the West African Genetic Medicine Centre (WAGMC), University of Ghana, Legon",
   "bodyLevel": "excerpt",
   "country": [
    "gh"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "eco",
    "pol"
   ],
   "tier": 4,
   "actor": "第三方",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "cnHit": false,
   "usHit": false,
   "terrHit": false,
   "riskHit": false,
   "riskKind": "",
   "score": 0.6,
   "tag": "rss_myjoyonline",
   "title_zh": "如果研究成果无法惠及产业，加纳将面临工业停滞的风险",
   "body_zh": "环境、科学与技术部长赞内托尔·阿吉曼-罗林斯警告称，如果加纳各大学和研究机构未能将科学发现转化为企业和产业切实可行的解决方案，该国将面临工业停滞的风险。她说，学术研究与商业应用之间的脱节，限制了加纳将科学知识转化为工业增长、就业创造和经济发展的能力。阿吉曼-罗林斯博士是在加纳大学勒贡西非遗传医学中心举行的2026年奥利弗·雷金纳德·（O.R.）坦博讲席计划（ORTARChI）会议开幕式上作出上述表态的。",
