   "_dt": 1793027637.0,
   "ageDays": 0.12,
   "summary": "The Kano State House of Assembly has screened six nominees forwarded by Governor Abba Kabir Yusuf for appointment as commissioners in his administration. The nominees are Ibrahim Namadi Dala, Mukhtar Ishaq Yakasai, Prof. Sani Lawan Malumfashi, Dr Aminu Ibrahim Tsanyawa, Idris Garba Mustapha and Salisu Yusha’u Soja. The Speaker of the House, Jibril Isma’il Falgore, had on Wednesday, October 21, read a letter from the governor requesting the Assembly to screen and confirm the nominees.",
   "summary_zh": "卡诺州议会已经审查了州长阿巴·卡比尔·优素福提交的6名获任命人，以出任其政府中的委员。获任命人分别是易卜拉欣·纳马迪·达拉、穆赫塔尔·伊沙克·亚卡赛、萨尼·拉万·马卢姆法希教授、阿米努·易卜拉欣·察尼亚瓦博士、伊德里斯·加尔巴·穆斯塔法和萨利苏·尤沙乌·索贾。州议会议长吉布里勒·伊斯梅尔·法尔戈雷于10月21日星期三宣读了州长的信函，请求议会审查并确认这些获任命人。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The Kano State House of Assembly has screened six nominees forwarded by Governor Abba Kabir Yusuf for appointment as commissioners in his administration. The nominees are Ibrahim Namadi Dala, Mukhtar Ishaq Yakasai, Prof. Sani Lawan Malumfashi, Dr Aminu Ibrahim Tsanyawa, Idris Garba Mustapha and Salisu Yusha’u Soja. The Speaker of the House, Jibril Isma’il Falgore, had on Wednesday, October 21, read a letter from the governor requesting the Assembly to screen and confirm the nominees. The nominations are part of the state government’s efforts to fill vacant commissioner positions following political realignments in the state. Join Daily Trust WhatsApp Community For Quick Access To News and Happenings Around You",
