   "summary": "This moment, however, presents an opportunity to demand the leadership Nigerians deserve. Nigeria does not need more punishment; it needs leaders that understand the weight of human suffering. The first step is clear: Attempted suicide must be decriminalised.",
   "summary_zh": "然而，此刻正是要求尼日利亚获得其应有领导者的机会。尼日利亚不需要更多惩罚，而是需要懂得人类苦难之重的领导者。第一步很明确：必须将企图自杀行为非刑罪化。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "This moment, however, presents an opportunity to demand the leadership Nigerians deserve. Nigeria does not need more punishment; it needs leaders that understand the weight of human suffering. The first step is clear: Attempted suicide must be decriminalised. People in crisis deserve care, not constraints. Criminalisation only worsens stigma, mental health problems, and hinders access […] The post appeared first on Premium Times Nigeria",
