   "title": "Abia govt has abandoned us — Ubani Market traders cry out, seek Otti’s intervention",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/10/abia-govt-has-abandoned-us-ubani-market-traders-cry-out-seek-ottis-intervention/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
