   "snippet": "China doesn't need soldiers to fight the Indian army on the border; they just need a few drone operators who can operate them with precision. \n\n< Almost every second Chinese company manufactures drones. \n< They have vast drone technology and production capacity.\n< They simply need to pinpoint the exact location of an military post, and they can launch an attack with thousands of drones without using infantry.\n< The Chinese are using drone technology for domestic work, logistics, farming, military, and many other things.",
